- if question.correct_answer.present?
  span.a-title-label.is-solved.is-success.js-solved-status id=dom_id(question, :solved_status)
    | 解決済
- elsif question.wip?
  span.a-title-label.is-wip id=dom_id(question, :solved_status)
    | WIP
- else
  span.a-title-label.is-solved.is-danger.js-solved-status id=dom_id(question, :solved_status)
    | 未解決
